1. What this package is, and where it comes from
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

web-mascot is a browser (TypeScript/JavaScript) port of the mascot simulation
engine found in NeurolingsCE-Qt and its upstream, Shijima-Qt / libshijima.

    Port author: CommentOut64


