1.2  The mascot format this engine implements
    -----------------------------------------

    This package contains no Shimeji or Shimeji-ee code. However, the mascot XML
    format it reads, and the `com.group_finity.mascot.*` action class names it
    implements, originate from these projects:

      * Shimeji — the original desktop mascot
        by Yuki Yamada of Group Finity
        http://www.group-finity.com/Shimeji/

      * Shimeji-ee — the English fork and community continuation
        by Kilkakon and the Shimeji-ee community
        https://kilkakon.com/shimeji/

    The mascot packs bundled with this package (section 3) are Shimeji-ee format
    packs.


