Modifications
-------------

CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 section 3(a)(1)(B) requires that modifications be indicated.
These are all of them:

    * actions.xml — the UTF-8 byte-order mark was removed.
    * actions.xml — the malformed expression `Math.random*100` was corrected to
      `Math.random()*100`, in two places per pack (four occurrences in total).
      The affected expression computes the wall-climb target; without the
      parentheses it evaluates to NaN.
    * info.json — a `"license"` field was added. No other field was changed.
    * img/*.png — byte-for-byte identical to upstream, unmodified.
    * behaviors.xml, bubble_context.txt — byte-for-byte identical, unmodified.

Nothing else in this package is affected by the CC license. In particular,
